'''Sirius{{'}} Personal Phone Number''' is a {{Legendary}} item that can be bought from the [[Dark Auction]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Dark Auction ===
'''Sirius{{'}} Personal Phone Number''' can be obtained from the {{zone|Dark Auction}} round 1, 3 or 4 for a minimum amount of {{c|1000000}}.

== Usage ==
If an [[Abiphone]] is in your inventory, you can right click while holding '''Sirius{{'}} Personal Phone Number''' to grant you with {{NPCSprite|Sirius}}' [[Abiphone]] contact as well as a {{Green|1%}} discount when buying items from the [[Dark Auction]].

